  "content": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/llm-tools-datasette/releases/tag/0.1.1\">llm-tools-datasette 0.1.1</a></p>\n        <p>When I switched LLM over to <a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/httpx2\">httpx2</a> in <a href=\"https://llm.datasette.io/en/stable/changelog.html#v0-33\">LLM 0.33</a> I forget that this would break any plugins which used <code>httpx</code> without directly depending on it. <code>llm-tools-datasette</code> was one of those plugins, now fixed.</p>\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\">datasette</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llm\">llm</a></p>",
